### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### LOOKUP FIELD VALUES WORKFLOW - Transaction System
### Base Route: api/LookUpFiledValues
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

@baseUrl = https://localhost:7010
@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..Q2jA5PJdQpjOZ9F0wnU_2GCorgyE4UQlEIGWMeofAmQ

@lookUpFieldId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@valueId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 1. GET ALL LOOKUP FIELD VALUES
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/LookUpFiledValues
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 2. GET VALUE BY ID
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/LookUpFiledValues/{{valueId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 3. GET VALUES BY LOOKUP FIELD ID
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/LookUpFiledValues/by-lookup-field/{{lookUpFieldId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 4. CREATE LOOKUP FIELD VALUE
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/LookUpFiledValues
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lookUpFiledId": "{{lookUpFieldId}}",
  "value": "Sample Value",
  "description": "Value description"
}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 5. UPDATE LOOKUP FIELD VALUE
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/LookUpFiledValues/{{valueId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": "Updated Value",
  "description": "Updated description"
}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 6. DELETE LOOKUP FIELD VALUE
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/LookUpFiledValues/{{valueId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
